: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Possible Solutions</strong></span></p><ul style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Contact Support.</span></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000002248-migration-of-existing-domains", "title": "Migration of existing domains", "folder": "Funnels &amp; Websites Builder", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155025272506/original/RywQnEDqmGFnoSwchrG47dq_LBZE2nwytg8649.png?1714457075", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155025272564/original/dJJI7oNtDA6lFgM9vXaUSIOAqkRGgpBbmAb275.png?1714457126"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">We're excited to announce a smoother process for migrating your existing domains to CloudFlare with our latest release. Say goodbye to the hassle of deletions and re-additions \u2013 introducing One-Click Migration with Domain Connect!</p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><ul><ul><li><a href=\"#Why-is-it-good-for-you-to-migrate-the-domains\">Why is it good for you to migrate the domains</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-switch?\">How to switch?</a></li></ul></ul></ul><hr><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Why-is-it-good-for-you-to-migrate-the-domains\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&qu